#: docs/silkie/browser-demo.rst:2
msgid "Try Silkie in your browser"
msgstr "在浏览器中试用 Silkie"

#: docs/silkie/browser-demo.rst:6
msgid ""
"A real Linux shell, running locally in this tab. Try basic commands, play Presidential, Silkie "
"Loophole, Ground Stop, Sprint, and Scramble, or connect to your own machines over SSH. The "
"terminal starts automatically."
msgstr ""
"真正的 Linux shell，就在当前标签页中本地运行。试试基本命令，玩 Presidential、Silkie Loophole、Ground Stop、Sprint 和 "
"Scramble，或者通过 SSH 连接自己的机器。终端会自动启动。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-demo.rst:10
msgid ""
"Click in the terminal to type. Drag to select text, then copy it as usual. Use **Fullscreen** for"
" more space and a slightly larger font. The game links below the terminal open a game filling its"
" own window, ready to play. Use **Fullscreen** there to hide the browser controls too."
msgstr ""
"点击终端即可输入，拖动选择文本后可照常复制。使用 **全屏** 获得更多空间和稍大的字体。终端下方的游戏链接会在独立窗口中打开游戏，窗口内即可开始游玩。在游戏窗口中使用 **全屏** "
"还可隐藏浏览器控件。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-demo.rst:15
msgid ""
":doc:`Install Silkie <install>` for the native terminal, or explore the :doc:`extension reference"
" <reference>`."
msgstr ":doc:`安装 Silkie <install>` 以使用原生终端，或浏览 :doc:`扩展参考手册 <reference>`。"

