#: docs/silkie/browser-demo.rst:21
msgid "Try these commands"
msgstr "试试这些命令"

#: docs/silkie/browser-demo.rst:33
msgid ""
"Click inside the terminal to type. Sprint and Scramble use arrows or WASD; press P to pause, then"
" Q to quit. In Loophole, walk with arrows or WASD, press Space to interact, and ? for help. In "
"Ground Stop, click an aircraft, steer it with WASD, Z, and X, and press Enter to land it; press Q"
" twice to quit. Presidential opens a campaign menu; use F1–F9 to explore the panels and ? for "
"help. The homepage shell and each game window can run together, with separate files and saves in "
"this browser's local storage. Clicking a game link again returns to its existing window. Keep one"
" window per game to protect its filesystem. Browser storage quotas still apply. ``silkie-"
"features`` formats its report for the current terminal width, including after resizing or "
"switching to fullscreen."
msgstr ""
"点击终端即可输入。Sprint 和 Scramble 使用方向键或 WASD 操作；按 P 暂停，再按 Q 退出。Loophole 使用方向键或 WASD 行走，空格键交互，? "
"查看帮助。Ground Stop 中点击飞机将其选中，用 WASD、Z 和 X 操纵，按 Enter 让它降落；连按两次 Q 退出。Presidential 启动后显示竞选菜单；使用 F1–F9"
" 浏览各面板，? 查看帮助。首页的 shell "
"与各游戏窗口可同时运行，文件和存档分别保存在浏览器的本地存储中。再次点击同一游戏链接会返回已有窗口。每款游戏只保留一个窗口，以保护其文件系统。浏览器的存储配额仍然适用。``silkie-"
"features`` 会按当前终端宽度排版报告，调整大小或切换全屏后也会适配。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-demo.rst:44
msgid "Connect to your machines"
msgstr "连接自己的机器"

#: docs/silkie/browser-demo.rst:46
msgid ""
"Choose **Connect to Tailscale** inside the terminal and follow the login link to join your own "
"network. Then use ``ssh your-user@your-tailscale-address`` in the shell. The page shows the "
"guest's connection status and address. SSH requires a destination SSH server and permission to "
"reach it."
msgstr ""
"在终端中选择 **连接 Tailscale**，点击登录链接，加入自己的网络。然后在 shell 中运行 ``ssh your-user@your-tailscale-"
"address``。页面会显示虚拟机的连接状态和地址。目标机器需要运行 SSH 服务，并允许你访问。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-demo.rst:51
msgid ""
"Silkie operates no public relay. You can use Ncat on your own Tailscale machine to relay to an "
"SSH server on your LAN. See :doc:`browser-ssh` for setup, commands, and host-key verification."
msgstr "Silkie 不提供公共中继。可以在自己的 Tailscale 机器上使用 Ncat，将连接转发到局域网内的 SSH 服务器。设置方法、命令和主机密钥验证见 :doc:`browser-ssh`。"

